1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:05,400
This is my impersonation of the Martin Luther King that you all quote, we want black people to shut up.

2
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:11,800
It is me, Martin Luther King Jr., the only civil rights leader who ever lived.

3
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:15,080
I had a dream and it came true.

4
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:18,780
So the rest of you Negroes can leave it alone now.

5
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:21,220
Why are you protesting in the street?

6
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:25,420
I would have never inconvenienced those nice white people like that.

7
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:26,680
They're just trying to get to work.

8
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:33,520
It is actually against the law for any black person to say something that contradicts anything that I said.

9
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:38,700
So if you hear it, tell them I'm disappointed in them and that it is illegal to say that.

10
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:43,220
Everybody loves me now, just like everybody loved me back then.

11
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:48,220
It's why I died of natural causes at the age of 98.

12
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:50,540
I only gave one speech.

13
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:52,100
Don't Google it.

14
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:57,460
I'm sure the person who has quoted me to you would have supported me back then as well.

15
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:01,500
Just ask their parents or their grandparents what they thought about me.

